# AI Smart Skill Coach - Product Documentation Roadmap

---

## 🎩 My Roles (4 Key Roles)

### 1️⃣ Product Analyst
- Product vision aur market positioning
- User needs aur pain points analysis
- Feature prioritization for market success
- Competitive analysis aur differentiation
- Product lifecycle management
- Go-to-market strategy alignment

### 2️⃣ Senior Business Analyst
- Requirements gathering aur stakeholder communication
- Business needs ko technical requirements mein convert karna
- Use cases aur user stories likhna
- Functional aur non-functional requirements define karna
- Gap analysis aur feasibility assessment
- Business process modeling

### 3️⃣ Senior Project Manager
- Project scope aur boundaries define karna
- Documentation roadmap create karna
- Resource planning aur timeline management
- Risk identification aur mitigation
- Stakeholder expectations manage karna
- Quality assurance aur deliverables tracking
- Sprint planning aur milestone management

### 4️⃣ Senior Full Stack AI Developer
- AI/ML system architecture design
- RAG pipeline technical planning
- Fine-tuning strategy (LoRA/PEFT)
- Model selection aur optimization
- AI-first development roadmap
- End-to-end system integration
- Technology stack decisions


