## 📋 SRS Document Structure (IEEE 830 + AI Extension)

### 1. Introduction
- 1.1 Purpose
- 1.2 Scope
- 1.3 Definitions, Acronyms, Abbreviations
- 1.4 References (IEEE Standards, AI Guidelines)
- 1.5 Document Overview

### 2. Overall Description
- 2.1 Product Perspective
- 2.2 Product Functions (Summary)
- 2.3 User Classes & Characteristics
- 2.4 Operating Environment
- 2.5 Design & Implementation Constraints
- 2.6 Assumptions & Dependencies

### 3. AI System Requirements ⭐ (Special Section)
- 3.1 RAG System Requirements
  - Document Processing Pipeline
  - Embedding Generation
  - Vector Storage & Retrieval
  - Response Generation
- 3.2 Fine-Tuning Requirements
  - Base Model Selection
  - Training Data Requirements
  - LoRA/PEFT Configuration
  - Domain Adapter Management
- 3.3 Personalization AI Requirements
  - Learning Analytics
  - Weak Area Detection
  - Recommendation Engine
- 3.4 AI Performance Metrics
  - Response Accuracy Targets
  - Latency Requirements
  - Hallucination Reduction Metrics

### 4. Functional Requirements
- FR-01: User Management
- FR-02: Document Management
- FR-03: AI Chat System
- FR-04: Assessment System
- FR-05: Certification System
- FR-06: Payment System
- FR-07: Admin Panel

### 5. Non-Functional Requirements
- NFR-01: Performance
- NFR-02: Security
- NFR-03: Scalability
- NFR-04: Reliability
- NFR-05: Usability
- NFR-06: Maintainability

### 6. External Interface Requirements
- 6.1 User Interfaces
- 6.2 Hardware Interfaces
- 6.3 Software Interfaces
- 6.4 Communication Interfaces

### 7. Advanced System Models & Diagrams
- 7.1 Use Case Diagrams
- 7.2 Data Flow Diagrams (DFD Level 0, 1, 2)
- 7.3 Sequence Diagrams
- 7.4 State Machine Diagrams
- 7.5 Class Diagrams
- 7.6 AI Pipeline Flow Diagrams

### 8. Data Requirements
- 8.1 Data Models
- 8.2 Data Dictionary
- 8.3 Data Validation Rules

### 9. Appendices
- 9.1 Glossary
- 9.2 Acronyms
- 9.3 Version History
- 9.4 Approval Signatures

